.TH IAD\-CAROUSEL 3 "" "iced-adaptive-design 0.1.0" "iced-adaptive-design Manual"
.SH NAME
carousel \- paginated, swipeable pages
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
carousel(pages: Vec<Element<'a, M, Theme>>, index: usize, on_navigate: impl Fn(usize) \-> M + 'a)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\fBAdwCarousel\fR: paginated, swipeable pages.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBAnimated.\fR The position scrolls with libadwaita's default scroll spring (damping ratio 1, mass 0.5, stiffness 500; \fBpresets::sidebar\fR).
.IP \(bu 2
\fBSwipeable.\fR Drag with the mouse; on release the drag velocity is handed to the spring (\fBinitial\-velocity\fR) and the carousel settles on the nearest page, publishing \fBon_navigate\fR.
.IP \(bu 2
\fBIndicators follow the position.\fR Dots grow and brighten gradually as their page nears (\fBAdwCarouselIndicatorDots\fR); with lines, the active line glides between pages (\fBAdwCarouselIndicatorLines\fR). Clicking an indicator navigates.
.PP
State is controlled: the app owns \fBindex\fR and updates it from \fBon_navigate\fR.
.SH FUNCTIONS
.TP
.B carousel(pages: Vec<Element<'a, M, Theme>>, index: usize, on_navigate: impl Fn(usize) \-> M + 'a)
An animated, swipeable carousel showing page \fBindex\fR.
